      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_001"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_002",
    "text": "This policy establishes leave entitlements, application procedures, approval levels, attendance expectations, extended leave requirements, and responsibilities for employees of NovaCore Technologies Pvt. Ltd.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "1. Purpose",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_002"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_003",
    "text": "This policy applies to employees unless a separate employment arrangement or applicable statutory requirement provides a different entitlement.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "2. Scope",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_003"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_004",
    "text": "The standard leave categories are Annual/Earned Leave, Casual Leave, Sick Leave, and Bereavement Leave.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "3. Leave Categories",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_004"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_005",
    "text": "Employees are entitled to 18 days of Annual/Earned Leave per applicable leave year.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "4. Annual Entitlement",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_005"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_006",
    "text": "Employees are entitled to 8 days of Casual Leave per applicable leave year, subject to business requirements and approval.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "5. Casual Leave",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_006"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_007",
    "text": "Employees are entitled to 10 days of Sick Leave per applicable leave year. Employees should inform their manager as soon as reasonably possible when absence is unplanned.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "6. Sick Leave",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_007"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_008",
    "text": "Employees may receive 5 days of Bereavement Leave for qualifying circumstances.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "7. Bereavement Leave",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_008"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_009",
    "text": "Planned leave should be requested through the designated process before the absence. Approval depends on the number of consecutive leave days:\n\n| Consecutive Leave   | Required Approval    |\n|---------------------|----------------------|\n| Up to 3 days        | Manager              |\n| 4-10 days           | Department Head      |\n| More than 10 days   | HR + Department Head |",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "8. Leave Application and Approval",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_009"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_010",
    "text": "Leave exceeding 10 consecutive days requires HR and Department Head approval. Supporting information may be requested where applicable.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "9. Extended Leave",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_010"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_011",
    "text": "Employees must notify their manager as soon as reasonably possible. Repeated or unexplained absence may be reviewed under applicable attendance procedures.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "10. Unplanned Absence",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_011"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_012",
    "text": "Managers should consider operational continuity and critical project requirements when reviewing planned leave. Business constraints do not remove the need for a fair and documented review.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "11. Critical Projects",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_012"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_013",
    "text": "Employees submit accurate leave requests and communicate unplanned absence. Managers review requests and business continuity. HR maintains policy guidance and employee records.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "12. Responsibilities",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_013"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_014",
    "text": "Exceptions may be considered for documented circumstances and applicable statutory or organizational requirements.",
    "metadata": {
      "department": "HR",
      "document_name": "Leave_Policy",
      "document_type": "PDF",
      "source_file": "data/raw/HR/Leave_Policy.pdf",
      "policy_title": "Employee Leave and Attendance Policy",
      "version": "2026",
      "effective_date": "01-Apr-2026",
      "owner_department": "HR",
      "document_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY",
      "section": "13. Exceptions",
      "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_014"
    }
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "HR_LEAVE_POLICY_CHUNK_015",
    "text": "2025 - Initial policy issued. 2026 - Leave entitlements and approval levels reviewed and updated.",
    "metadata": {
